SUMMARY:⚽ FIFA World Cup 2026 – Semi-Final Watch Party!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Join us on **Wednesday\, July 15th at 3:00 PM** as we watch one of the big
 gest matches in world soccer—the **FIFA World Cup Semi-Final**!\nWhether
  you're a lifelong football supporter or simply enjoy the excitement of ma
 jor sporting events\, this is a great opportunity to experience the drama\
 , passion\, and atmosphere with fellow fans.\nCome cheer on your favorite 
 team\, enjoy lively conversation\, and make some new friends in a relaxed 
 and welcoming setting.\n\n**Date:** Wednesday July 15th\n**Arrival Time:**
  Please arrive between 3:00 pm -3:45 pm (If you can)\n(Ask for Steve from 
 Meetup when you arrive or look for us in our reserved section}\n**Where to
  Meet us?**\n**Location:** Smoke Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Fr
 ee Parking:** in Residential area and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north o
 f Eglinton\n**Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant Subway:** (Very close\, 1 minute w
 alking distance)\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social groups too so we can ant
 icipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\n\\*Match starts at 3:00 pm\n\nSincerely\,
 \n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n**⚽ FIFA World Cup 2026 – Semi
 -Final Watch Party!**\n**What to expect:**\n\n* Live viewing of the FIFA W
 orld Cup Semi-Final\n* Friendly soccer fans and great conversation\n* A fu
 n\, social atmosphere\n* Food and drinks available for purchase from the v
 enue\n\nFeel free to wear your favorite team's jersey or colors and bring 
 your World Cup spirit!\n**Hosted by Steve Flemming (Soul City Social Club)
 **\nWe look forward to watching another unforgettable chapter in World Cup
  history with you!\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n5 dollars (cash only please) (HST inclu
 ded)\nor in advance by e transfer to **[steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://
 steveflemming11@gmail.com/)**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminder:**\n\\*One beverage or appeti
 zer minimum to support the venue and servers- this is greatly appreciated 
 :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
