SUMMARY:The Wednesday Night Poker\, Euchre and Pool with Friends!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Looking for a fun and relaxed evening with good people? Come join me\, Ste
 ve Flemming\, for a casual games night featuring poker\, euchre\, cards\, 
 and pool. Whether you're a seasoned player or just looking to learn\, ever
 yone is welcome. This isn't about high stakes or intense competition—it'
 s about enjoying great conversation\, sharing a few laughs\, meeting new f
 riends\, and spending time together in a friendly\, respectful atmosphere.
  Bring your sense of humor\, your favorite card-playing strategies\, and g
 et ready for an enjoyable night of games and community. I look forward to 
 seeing you around the table!\n\n-Reserved seating\, friendly people\, good
  conversation and great food awaits!\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social grou
 ps too so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\n\\*This is just a fun
  event and obviously we are only playing with poker chips. (All levels wel
 come) :)\n\n**Date:** Wednesday July 15th\n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive
  between 6:00 pm -7:30 pm (If you can)\n(Ask for Steve from Meetup when yo
 u arrive or look for us in our reserved section.\n**Where to Meet us?**\n*
 *Location:** Smoke Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** 
 in Residential area and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**
 Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant Subway:** (Very close\, 1 minute walking distanc
 e)\n\nEvent Details Bellow:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/H
 ost)\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Wednesday Night Poker\, Euchre and Pool with
  Friends!**\n\nJoin us for a relaxed and enjoyable evening of poker\, euch
 re\, pool\, great conversation\, and the opportunity to meet new friends i
 n a fun\, welcoming atmosphere.\n\n**Event Highlights**\n· Play poker\, e
 uchre\, and other card games—whether you're experienced or just learning
 \n· Enjoy a few friendly games of pool while relaxing and getting to know
  new people\n· Meet new friends\, share some laughs\, and spend the eveni
 ng in a respectful\, low-pressure social setting\n\n**Event Fee:**\n5 doll
 ars (if you arrive between 6:00 pm and 6:50 pm\n(cash only please) (HST in
 cluded)\n10 dollars if you arrive after 6:51 pm\nor in advance by e transf
 er to **[steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com/)**\n
 \n\\*Fee includes optional Karaoke later on in the evening\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminder:**\n\\*One beverage or appetiz
 er minimum to support the venue and servers- this is greatly appreciated :
 )\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
